          "homepage": "https://epic-pictures.com/film/the-huntsman",
          "overview": "When an ICU nurse volunteers to help a coma patient accused of murdering six women, he’s drawn into a chilling web of lies, obsession, and deadly secrets as a detective races to stop the killer.",
